<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Réinitialisation de mot de passe — polypdf</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { background: #f4f4f8; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #1a1a2e; }
        .wrapper { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
        .card { background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0f1a, #1a1a2e); padding: 36px 40px; text-align: center; }
        .logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
        .logo-icon { width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,59,48,0.2), rgba(255,140,66,0.15)); border: 1px solid rgba(255,59,48,0.3); border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        .logo-text { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
        .logo-poly { color: #ffffff; }
        .logo-pdf { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff3b30, #ff8c42); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
        .body { padding: 40px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f0f1a; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .text { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; color: #4a4a6a; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .btn-wrap { text-align: center; margin: 32px 0; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 36px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff3b30, #ff6b35); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.01em; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255,59,48,0.3); }
        .divider { height: 1px; background: #eeeef4; margin: 28px 0; }
        .expire { font-size: 13px; color: #8888a0; text-align: center; }
        .warning { background: #fff8f0; border: 1px solid #ffb340; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #7a5200; }
        .fallback { background: #f8f8fc; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .fallback p { font-size: 12px; color: #8888a0; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .fallback a { font-size: 12px; color: #ff3b30; word-break: break-all; }
        .footer { background: #f8f8fc; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #eeeef4; }
        .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #9999b0; line-height: 1.6; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card">

        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">
                <div class="logo-icon">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                        <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"
                              stroke="url(#rg)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"
                                  stroke="url(#rg)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        <defs>
                            <linearGradient id="rg" x1="4" y1="2" x2="20" y2="22">
                                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#ff3b30"/>
                                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ff8c42"/>
                            </linearGradient>
                        </defs>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="logo-text">
                    <span class="logo-poly">poly</span><span class="logo-pdf">pdf</span>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="body">
            <p class="greeting">Réinitialisation de mot de passe</p>
            <p class="text">
                Nous avons reçu une demande de réinitialisation du mot de passe associé à votre compte <strong>polypdf</strong>. Cliquez sur le bouton ci-dessous pour choisir un nouveau mot de passe.
            </p>

            <div class="btn-wrap">
                <a href="{{ url('app_reset_password', {token: resetToken.token}) }}" class="btn">
                    Réinitialiser mon mot de passe
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="expire">
                Ce lien expire dans <strong>{{ resetToken.expirationMessageKey|trans(resetToken.expirationMessageData, 'ResetPasswordBundle') }}</strong>.
            </div>

            <div class="warning">
                ⚠️ Si vous n'avez pas demandé de réinitialisation, ignorez cet e-mail. Votre mot de passe restera inchangé.
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <p class="text">Si le bouton ne fonctionne pas, copiez ce lien dans votre navigateur :</p>
            <div class="fallback">
                <p>Lien de réinitialisation :</p>
                <a href="{{ url('app_reset_password', {token: resetToken.token}) }}">
                    {{ url('app_reset_password', {token: resetToken.token}) }}
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>
                Vous recevez cet e-mail car une demande de réinitialisation a été effectuée sur polypdf.<br>
                © {{ "now"|date("Y") }} polypdf — Tous droits réservés.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
